<!-- PAD: VERTICAL -->
{diagram direction='TB', title='How a packed application answers'}
  P([A page, its fetch, its EventSource]) --> W[The service worker - or, from the disk, the page around the frame]
  W --> R[The runtime: pad-app.js]
  R -->|a www file| B[(The bundle)]
  R -->|a page| H[PHP as WebAssembly, the PAD engine]
  H --> S[(SQLite under DATA)]
  S -.->|after each request| I[(IndexedDB)]
{/diagram}
